  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "RenderPipeline is the core rendering engine orchestrator, managing the entire frame generation lifecycle. It sequences rendering passes, including shadow map generation, scene rendering into off-screen targets, and applying post-processing effects. It dynamically adjusts resolution based on frame time against a target budget, relying heavily on RenderPipelineSettings for configuration like tone mapping and quality presets."
  },
